---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Terms of Service - Rehman Veterinary Clinic Lahore</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Terms of Service and Conditions for Rehman Veterinary Clinic Lahore." />
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans selection:bg-emerald-200 selection:text-emerald-900">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/" class="text-emerald-600 font-bold hover:underline mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to Home</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg">
      <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">By booking a consultation or mobile visit with <strong>Rehman Veterinary Clinic Lahore</strong>, you agree to abide by these Terms of Service. Whether you are using our <strong>24 hour animal hospital lahore</strong> hotline or requesting a <strong>home visit vet lahore</strong>, these terms apply to all services.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. Services Provided</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Dr. Saif provides mobile veterinary services, including emergency consultations, lab work, and operates as a mobile <strong>pet vaccination center</strong>. While we strive to act as the best <strong>emergency vet lahore</strong>, certain critical surgeries may require referral to a physical facility.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">3. Payment and Fees</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Payment is due at the time of service. We accept cash, online transfers, and mobile wallets. If you found us by searching "<strong>vet near me</strong>", please ensure you are located within our Lahore service area for house calls.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">4. Cancellations</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">If you need to cancel a mobile visit, please notify us at least 2 hours in advance so we can assist other pets in need.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">5. Liability</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">While we provide the highest standard of care, veterinary medicine is not an exact science. <strong>Rehman Veterinary Clinic Lahore</strong> cannot guarantee the outcome of any medical treatment or procedure.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">6. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">For any service-related inquiries, please contact us at info@rehmanvetclinic.com or +92 311 4899904.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
